    <briefdescription>
<para>A block-structured sparse matrix with shared sparsity across all blocks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Values are stored in monolithic CSR order: the nBlocks*nCells monolithic rows are laid out contiguously. Total values size is nBlocks^2 * nnz. </para>
